Do we know about this paper:

http://www.stat.umn.edu/geyer/morph/VariableTransformation.pdf

There is an R implementation in their mcmc package and examples here

http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/mcmc/vignettes/morph.pdf

I am too tired to fully understand it right now, but it seems as if there could be an option in Stan to do transformations like these on the unconstrained variables that would be at least as user-friendly as their R implementation.

Ben

